# Echoly extension — DEV-mode env (loaded by `wxt build --mode development` /
# `wxt dev`; Vite convention `.env.[mode]`). Committed: contains NO secrets,
# just localhost URLs that match `make dev-server` + `make dev-web`.
#
# `WXT_*` prefix exposes values to client code at build time (WXT docs).
#
# Override locally without touching git: put your values in `.env.development.local`
# (gitignored). Plain `.env` and `.env.local` are also gitignored.
#
# Prod builds (`wxt build` / `wxt zip`) DO NOT read this file — the `??`
# fallbacks in src/shared/constants.ts (api.echolyhq.com / echolyhq.com) win.
# Verify with: `npx wxt build` → `.output/chrome-mv3/chunks/*.js` should
# contain `api.echolyhq.com`, never `localhost`.

WXT_ECHOLY_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8787
WXT_ECHOLY_WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4321
